WEBVTT

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:48.410
Shichisei, huh?

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:52.920
I've heard about this before.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:55.870
If a group of Corpses are able to work together does that mean...

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:59.430
Corpses are just a pile of waste of those who are attached to this world.

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:02.470
In other words they only move obeying their attachment.

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:05.140
Do you really think those things can team up?

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:06.420
Saki!

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:08.290
She's right.

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:11.990
But they do exist.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:17.610
The only thing we know is that one of them has 7 stars engraved on her face.

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:21.550
And that their objective isn't merely massacring the living.

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:26.070
There are many other Corpses among their victims.

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:30.750
What other purpose than slaughtering people could Corpses have?

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:32.640
We're still investigating that matter.

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:35.820
Please take this picture to Keisei.

00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:36.500
Yes.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:38.270
But why?

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:40.030
You'll know when he gets it.

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:43.140
I'll survey this Shichisei case.

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:44.490
Kamika!

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:46.320
Please wait just a moment.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.920
I can't find the sutras that are supposed to be here.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:51.440
Look for it later.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:54.910
Shichisei have appeared.

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:04.520
Note: Shuhouha: Faction of prayers & Shujouha: Faction of living beings
The Shuhouha and Shujouha?

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:05.430
That's right.

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:08.560
The Kougon has been divided in two factions.

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:15.730
Their number 2, Great Bishop Gon, is part of the Shuhouha and is against the way the Corpses have been used until now.

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:19.830
How can those failures defeat Corpses anyway?

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:23.120
Man can make a word that can't be attached to.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:34.720
In other words, if the Shuhouha perishes, the Shujouha will gain control, and Shikabane Hime will cease to be used.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:40.560
We must make the Shikabane Hime's and Contracted Priests our target. And thus damage the Shuhouha.

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:42.400
You sure have it all planned out.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:44.610
You live up to your name, Betrayer Priest.

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:47.770
Do you want to use us as a replacement for your collection of souls?

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:50.690
No, I shall make a new one.

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:52.120
There is one condition though.

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:55.430
You are just a living human being.

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:58.340
We can't fully trust you.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.060
What do you want me to do?

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:01.740
Prove it to us.

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:06.020
Prove to us that you've thrown away your human heart completely.

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:11.470
What's this?

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:13.680
This watery image?

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:18.970
Don't betray!

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:23.960
Don't betray the Shichisei Hokuto!

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:27.940
I'll prove it to you.

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:33.870
I'll prove you that I've thrown away all my human feelings, except for those that want to destroy the Kougon.

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:52.170
He's here! He's here!

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:52.930
Let's go.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:56.760
Oori's here!

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:58.400
Hide quickly!

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:16.030
I feel like everyone hates me.

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:18.620
No, they don't, Oori.

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:20.010
But...

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:37.390
It's tomorrow right?

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:38.380
You're turning sixteen.

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.140
That's right.

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:49.530
This is genius.

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:51.240
I didn't study Zadan techniques at all.

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:56.070
I'm not sure if I'll be able to use it well.

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:59.670
Note: Shikimi and Boke are sacred Japanese plants.
Mixing Shikimi and Boke makes a good defense.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.490
This is an ingeniously written sutra.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:07.490
This can become a good third-level, or even a second-level protector.

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:09.090
You think so?

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:12.920
But for the betrayer's curses, you'll need a special protector, right?

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:16.530
When did you start writing such a sutra?

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:21.670
You didn't possible steal Takamine's sutras!?

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:22.840
Yeah.

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:24.280
I grabbed them the other day.

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:25.450
Shikei...

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:28.490
There's a lot of national classified information in there too.

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:35.110
I grabbed it without thinking, so I could have gotten some of those too.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:41.700
Are you planning to use yourself as a catalyst for Zadan techniques?

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:42.880
Yes.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:44.690
Could you hold on to that for me?

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:47.890
So I can be assured...

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:49.520
If something happens...

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:50.980
Shikei?

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:54.810
Saki and Aragami-san?

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.000
Why did she come?

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:58.460
I called her in.

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:01.680
I felt that she should see this too.

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:09.950
These are medicine for you.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:15.500
These before, these after your meal and these before sleeping.

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:17.500
Thank you.

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:20.410
And this is from High Priest Takamine.

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:26.810
There's no doubt?

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:28.180
Keisei...

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:30.500
Are these the next...

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:31.540
Yeah.

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:32.850
Probably.

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:37.760
Really?

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:54.030
I've been looking for you, Shichisei.

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:55.480
What?

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.260
I though you weren't coming near us again?

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:02.540
But I saw that girl with that star-thing on her face the other day.

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:03.940
You saw her?!

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:05.340
Where?

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:07.950
At the religious organization for research of eternal life.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:09.870
Why did you go to such a place?

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:12.010
Isn't that that phony religious place?

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:17.390
I hoped there was another way but the Kougon one of helping people like you.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:19.960
What are you talking about?

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:26.000
You are a Shikabane Hime, because you didn't have another choice.

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.790
Isn't that just like a punishment?

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:30.530
A punishment?

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.200
Not at all.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.790
I wanted to become a Shikabane Hime.

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:36.070
I volunteered.

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:41.980
Are you okay?

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:54.840
Those sure are a lot of ingredients.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:57.820
You won't grow strong from a vegetarian diet.

00:08:58.310 --> 00:08:59.300
You need meat!

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:00.540
I won't give you any though.

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:04.280
Are you putting spices in there?

00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:06.630
Why do you put so many in?

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:11.830
A long time ago I tried a lot of spices to make decent food.

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:13.730
And I got used to using them.

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:15.840
I just wanted you to eat.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:19.630
Did you do that for me?

00:09:20.010 --> 00:09:21.610
Well then.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:26.730
I told you before that I lost my parents at a young age, right?

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:32.310
The one that took care of me was the priest Hoshimura from the Honkesu temple.

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:34.050
Hoshimura?

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:08.950
I left the Hoshimuras because I wanted to train at the Honzan.

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:13.750
I hardly ever came back after that.

00:10:22.090 --> 00:10:26.050
I became employed at the Sekuu temple, where I met Riko and the old lady.

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:30.880
At that time both the Sekuu Temple and the Dairinkan were in an awful state.

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:36.100
It took a lot of time and money to restore them.

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:39.590
And then you came.

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:45.810
And ten years later...

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:52.460
I was informed that Hoshimura's place was attacked by Corpses and burned down.

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:00.930
It was a group of Corpses that executed the attack.

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:04.060
Later we found out they were called Shichisei.

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:07.310
Are those the ones in that picture from earlier?

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:20.400
Keisei.

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:22.300
Old man.

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:25.100
There is still a chance for the Hoshimura's daughter.

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:28.400
Today we are going to make you a Contracted Priest.

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:37.100
She's being restrained to stop her from becoming a Corpse.

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:41.610
But if we don't contract her fast, she won't be herself anymore.

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:43.680
But I...

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:47.120
You and her already have a bond.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:49.360
You are the only one able to be contracted with her.

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.270
Makina.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:57.940
Keisei?

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:00.350
Please contract with me.

00:12:00.890 --> 00:12:04.610
Do you understand what it means to become a Shikabane Hime?

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:06.520
I'll do anything.

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:08.400
I want you to fight alongside me.

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:12.720
So that we can kill those who murdered my family and me.

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:26.000
You told me before that Hoshimura-san didn't become a Shikabane Hime to go to heaven.

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:29.290
The Shichisei aren't ordinary Corpses.

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:31.270
I don't want you to get involved this time.

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:34.260
But, brother...

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:37.210
I made a promise.

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:39.090
I will fight alongside her.

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:49.990
I understand now, brother.

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:54.380
I understand that I know nothing about Contracted Priests or Shikabane Hime.

00:12:55.090 --> 00:12:57.760
I was angry with you for hiding this.

00:12:58.440 --> 00:12:59.000
Yeah.

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:03.040
Even now, I can't trust the Kougon who killed Minai.

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:08.940
But I do know that you are the same brother that always took care of me.

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:14.870
Priests aren't here for the dead, but for the living that are in sorrow.

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:18.080
I'm sorry.

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:22.570
Those words made me feel better.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:24.050
Oori?

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:27.740
I've got a special present for your birthday tomorrow.

00:13:28.230 --> 00:13:31.830
A limited edition life size figure of Pujito.

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:45.580
Tomorrow...

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:53.490
I'm sorry!

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:55.430
Here.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.920
Thank you so much!

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:03.310
So cute.

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:09.440
He is a seducer.

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:10.520
Ena-san?

00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:13.390
You'll puke if you know what's inside of him.

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:16.950
Now there is a connection between him and Ena-san.

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:20.030
We only have to wait for tonight now.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:24.630
Let's kill them.

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:02.050
Keisei?

00:15:03.140 --> 00:15:04.470
Keisei?

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:07.850
Why did they all fall asleep?

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:09.270
It must be a Corpse's curse.

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:12.960
But they must know it doesn't work on us.

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:16.270
In other words, they just wanted to challenge us.

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:18.390
And put them to sleep to prevent hindrance.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:20.960
They're calling us to come out.

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:48.150
Again?

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:50.070
What do you want?

00:15:52.710 --> 00:15:53.250
Bruises?

00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:30.340
I can't believe the Corpses are coming to attack us directly.

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:34.460
That means they are well mentally capable.

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:35.970
Shichisei.

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:38.770
Or maybe, the betrayer priest.

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:42.940
What would you do if it were both?

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:53.010
Kisou Renge?

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:04.110
Hoshimura girl!

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:05.330
Long time no see!

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:13.960
You're that girl that ran through the neighborhood, crying for help.

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:16.130
What a foolish decision to come back alive.

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:17.910
How pathetic.

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:19.420
Shichisei!

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:21.610
Aren't you scared?

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:28.770
Not only did you steal the Akasha, you used Corpses and now you even got help from the Shichisei.

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:32.350
I am the one who is helping them, Shikei.

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:34.600
What do you hope to achieve with this?

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:38.280
I want to annihilate all Shikabane Hime's and the Kougon.

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:40.730
And I'll start with you.

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:44.540
We trained and grew up at the same temple.

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:47.400
Tell me what happened that day.

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:50.580
You are right, Shikei.

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:53.120
I trained together with you.

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:56.080
And I looked up to you.

00:17:56.980 --> 00:17:59.070
I had nothing against you.

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:06.210
We trained together not longing for death, nor fearing it, to help those who were sorrowing.

00:18:18.090 --> 00:18:19.740
You are a great Contracted Priest.

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:23.360
You should become a Contracted Priest too.

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:24.240
Yeah.

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:28.460
We also need the power of a Shikabane Hime.

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:32.870
I'm planning to contract whenever I get a chance.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.550
I understand what you want to say.

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:38.340
But I just don't feel like it yet.

00:18:39.990 --> 00:18:40.740
Why?

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:44.430
Before growing up and making those girls fight,

00:18:45.240 --> 00:18:47.850
I want to fight on my own, just a bit longer.

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:52.130
I feel like I won't be able to forgive myself if I don't.

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:59.440
I trusted you.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.550
I thought you had the right way of thinking.

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:05.530
That is the reason why...

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:10.050
I couldn't handle the truth that day.

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:13.200
The truth?

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:18.360
Killing you here today is necessary for me to be reborn.

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:22.080
To become one of the living dead.

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:28.500
I just can't follow those livings way of thinking.

00:19:29.090 --> 00:19:29.950
That outfit...

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:32.520
Are you the Corpse of a priest?

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:36.180
Is it that obvious?

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:38.680
Priests only work with people.

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:40.930
You can't save anyone.

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:45.340
Do you really think you can save that girl?

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:50.420
The only thing you're doing is letting that girl go through another hell,

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:53.810
instead of the one she should have been gone to a long time ago.

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:55.180
Shut up!

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:14.450
Just as I thought.

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:18.190
Your curse isn't as strong as before.

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:24.790
He's far from having a hundred and eight souls.

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.650
I shouldn't fear this Zadan technique.

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:30.090
I know your weak point.

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:33.150
Because I had the same one before.

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:38.930
Do you even wonder why we came to such an advantageous place for you?

00:20:39.480 --> 00:20:43.920
Because you have something to protect here.

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:48.220
Keisei, go!

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:49.350
But...

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:50.810
Don't worry about me.

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:53.140
I finally met the Shichisei again.

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.510
They are my prey!

00:20:58.300 --> 00:20:59.530
This makes it one on one.

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:02.040
Kowaku of the Shichisei!

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:11.070
It's still intact.

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:13.930
What could this mean?

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:26.690
Oori?

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:28.110
Brother.

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:30.000
You look confused.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:31.340
Yeah.

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:34.170
Why are you here?

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:37.830
Couldn't you get any sleep?

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:41.290
I can't sleep...

00:21:46.510 --> 00:21:50.320
...on such a pleasant night.

00:23:26.220 --> 00:23:29.430
On a night that feels like it lasts forever...

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:31.770
You might think you can't cry any more...

00:23:31.770 --> 00:23:33.420
But still you can't stop crying.

00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:35.750
Cry more.

00:23:35.750 --> 00:23:38.450
Dawn is still far away.
